    {"dot":"cyan","title":"Frontend owns interaction","items":["React renders Chat, the builder and results. Browser adapters own canvas conversion, stores and network calls.","Browser previews call the portable graph runner in the browser process."]},
    {"dot":"violet","title":"Shared code is a library","items":["workflow-core owns commands and graph rules. workflow-contracts defines persisted types and validators.","workflow-executors supplies the registry injected by both runtimes. These boxes are code packages, not remote services."]},
